cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Ancient Greek LLM Stylometry: an LREC Resource and Evaluation"
message: "If you use this resource, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Mikros
    given-names: George
abstract: >-
  A chunk-level corpus and evaluation of state-of-the-art LLM-generated Ancient
  Greek (GPT-5.5, Claude 4.8; with GPT-4o and Claude 3.5 as a longitudinal
  baseline) compared stylometrically and linguistically to human Attic orators.
keywords:
  - Ancient Greek
  - stylometry
  - large language models
  - language resource
  - computational linguistics
